[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9961.91, "timestamp": "02:46:01", "text": "娱乐与激情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9965.75, "timestamp": "02:46:05", "text": "以及那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9969.75, "timestamp": "02:46:09", "text": "喜欢逗人开心之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9978.87, "timestamp": "02:46:18", "text": "另一种人则是为了……而这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9981.349, "timestamp": "02:46:21", "text": "钱，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9983.59, "timestamp": "02:46:23", "text": "正确的？那些为了钱而做这件事的人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9986.23, "timestamp": "02:46:26", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9989.99, "timestamp": "02:46:29", "text": "然后他们就得到了……呃，该怎么称呼它呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9993.349, "timestamp": "02:46:33", "text": "他们太沉迷于名利了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9995.83, "timestamp": "02:46:35", "text": "东西、衣服，所有的一切。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9999.99, "timestamp": "02:46:39", "text": "他们开始变得疯狂，彻底疯了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10002.469, "timestamp": "02:46:42", "text": "呃，到处都是，而且非常大"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10004.95, "timestamp": "02:46:44", "text": "混乱，或许在最后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10007.51, "timestamp": "02:46:47", "text": "即使如此，他们也可能不满意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10009.269, "timestamp": "02:46:49", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10012.309, "timestamp": "02:46:52", "text": "呃，就像你再次看到的那样，所以游戏"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10015.19, "timestamp": "02:46:55", "text": "确实需要，还有，你好，Hideasa，你好"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10018.389, "timestamp": "02:46:58", "text": "你好吗？希望你一切都好。"}]